# Build output.
#
# `go build` with no -o writes the binary here, named after the module. It is
# ~73 MB — mostly the statically linked pdf_oxide/office_oxide Rust cores — and
# it has been committed by accident once already. Anchored with a leading slash
# so it only matches the repo root, leaving the directory name itself alone.
/mcp-searxng-relay

# `go test -c` and `go test -o` output.
*.test

# Coverage profiles from `go test -coverprofile`.
*.cover
coverage.out

# Native dependency artefacts, if anyone installs them into the tree rather
# than the module cache. The Dockerfile and ci.yml both keep these outside the
# repo, but a local `go run .../cmd/install` invoked from here would not.
/pdf_oxide_lib/
/office_oxide_lib/
libpdf_oxide.a
liboffice_oxide.a
office_oxide.h

# Delve's default binary name.
__debug_bin*
